      "updated": 1794409200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UNKNOWN is not non-compliance; contested outcomes go to officials.\nRequest: affected parcel / issue, rule, response deadline and next action.\nNo response / late evidence: reassess available facts under approved rules.\nTrack affected scope / amount; never infer a whole-claim adverse result.",
      "originalText": "UNKNOWN is not non-compliance; contested outcomes go to officials.\nRequest: affected parcel / issue, rule, response deadline and next action.\nNo response / late evidence: reassess available facts under approved rules.\nTrack affected scope / amount; never infer a whole-claim adverse result.",
